## solution

#### using two pointers

```js
const compress = (s) => {
  let result = [];
  let i = 0;
  let j = 0;

  while (j <= s.length) {
    if (s[i] === s[j]) {
      j += 1;
    } else {
      const num = j - i;
      if (num === 1) {
        result.push(s[i]);
      } else {
        result.push(String(num), s[i]);
      }
      i = j;
    }
  }

  return result.join('');
};
```

- n = length of string
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

